            "review_title": "Review at Bun Thit Nuong Kieu Bao",
            "review_text": "Samantha P\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam31 contributions\n0\nAmazingly authentic\nMay 2019 • Friends\nI stumbled upon this restaurant with a friend. At first glance, it looks like a place that would make a foreigner sick. However, we decided to try it as there were nothing but local people and it was incredibly busy with high turn over. The food is super cheap and is absolutely outstanding. The atmosphere is really cool with people driving their motorbikes inside, parking and eating. This really is a no muss, no fuss type of place to eat with little-to-no waiting time. I would definitely recommend checking it out. I have been back numerous times since relocating to HCMC.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten May 26, 2019",
