            "review_title": "Review at Bun Thit Nuong Kieu Bao",
            "review_text": "DJP16\nSaskatoon, Canada49 contributions\n0\nNot to be missed\nApr 2019 • Couples\nA young couple who wanted to practice English with us in the park took us here. Wow! We always look for local getaways and this was it. Ignore the motorbikes parked on the main and go upstairs. Place your order ahead and await cheap, excellent grilled pork/vermicelli/spring rolls. The 4 litre fish sauce pails made me smile. Just two blocks away from the over-priced Bui Vien Walking St restos which made our many return trips worthwhile. Cheapest and most excellent simple menu in the district.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 20, 2019",
